    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Users reported that Google as a human OIDC provider failed because client_secret was missing. An August 6, 2025 feedback comment described planned optional client-secret support. This is historical compatibility evidence, not proof that Google workforce login remains unsupported in October 2026. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2025-08-06)",
          "source": "https://feedback.mongodb.com/ideas/CUSTOMER-I-8665",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a7dc5eabe3c8cd8915d3907966638ba8a2993804080cb10502a517d026664f3c",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:3ba35eb67b04ee9c81e2fceb9e902c57e2ae65447469c168d2863acc29964d45",
            "ev:95c18d2a69a957def876a91fe72b7f0b7e287a9ee9642e7a354ffabaf629e31e"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/workforce-identity-federation-with-oidc-to-support-google/295993"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Workforce federation requires JWT tokens and rejects opaque access tokens. Google documents ordinary user access tokens as opaque; generic OIDC compatibility therefore does not establish that a Google human-login flow satisfies Atlas workforce requirements. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23) Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/workforce-oidc.md ; https://cloud.google.com/docs/authentication/token-types",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/workforce-oidc.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:8d91dc24e5b6112bdce956382337e27ba55126a9116e0621b7f025a07e686ccd",
          "validationStatus": "REMEDIATED-PROJECTION",
          "evidenceIds": [],
          "also": [
            "https://docs.cloud.google.com/docs/authentication/token-types",
            "https://cloud.google.com/docs/authentication/token-types"
          ],
          "originValidationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "originEvidenceIds": [
            "ev:2a06dfc42df240cbfcd86388a10e1a55185ef0185c47a5e22d35827377f9e40c",
            "ev:45734ba6f58b9656293f1e4cd678f4b3535e3d63a1d40792c9b0edeec825713f"
          ],
          "remediation": {
            "schema": "claim-remediation-projection/v1",
